From: Stained Glass OS <ke7oxh@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] msvcrt: Implement _iswcsym_l and _iswcsymf_l.

_iswcsym_l and _iswcsymf_l (letters, digits only for the first, and
underscore, in the given locale) were spec stubs in msvcr80 and later and
ucrtbase; msvcr120_app forwards. ucrtbase's _o___pwctype_func and
_o__ismbclower were stubs although the plain forms are implemented.
---
 dlls/msvcr100/msvcr100.spec         |  4 ++--
 dlls/msvcr110/msvcr110.spec         |  4 ++--
 dlls/msvcr120/msvcr120.spec         |  4 ++--
 dlls/msvcr120_app/msvcr120_app.spec |  4 ++--
 dlls/msvcr80/msvcr80.spec           |  4 ++--
 dlls/msvcr90/msvcr90.spec           |  4 ++--
 dlls/msvcrt/ctype.c                 | 21 +++++++++++++++++++++
 dlls/ucrtbase/ucrtbase.spec         |  8 ++++----
 8 files changed, 37 insertions(+), 16 deletions(-)

diff --git a/dlls/msvcr100/msvcr100.spec b/dlls/msvcr100/msvcr100.spec
index 0cf11dc..0e04e28 100644
--- a/dlls/msvcr100/msvcr100.spec
+++ b/dlls/msvcr100/msvcr100.spec
@@ -1190,8 +1190,8 @@
 @ cdecl _iswalnum_l(long ptr)
 @ cdecl _iswalpha_l(long ptr)
 @ cdecl _iswcntrl_l(long ptr)
-@ stub _iswcsym_l
-@ stub _iswcsymf_l
+@ cdecl _iswcsym_l(long ptr)
+@ cdecl _iswcsymf_l(long ptr)
 @ cdecl _iswctype_l(long long ptr)
 @ cdecl _iswdigit_l(long ptr)
 @ cdecl _iswgraph_l(long ptr)
